<title>CANADA: Nortel sees 15-20 pct sales growth in 97.</title>
<headline>Nortel sees 15-20 pct sales growth in 97.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Telecom Ltd President and Chief Executive Officer Jean Monty expects the telecommunications equipment company's revenues to grow between 15 and 20 percent in 1997 after rising 20 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;It's fair to say it's going to be in the 15 to 20 percent range,&quot; Monty said in an interview on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Earnings should grow faster than revenues,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
